{"type":"text","timestamp":1778525644827,"sessionID":"ses_1e7b5a812ffedIJcejtJsoyBlk","part":{"id":"prt_e186253d6001snuOBh0dYDJUZ1","messageID":"msg_e18621d660012mlWux9kQblJYC","sessionID":"ses_1e7b5a812ffedIJcejtJsoyBlk","type":"text","text":"---\n**Plan for Issue #3536:**\n1.  **Term ID and Property Identification**: I've identified `RO_0000053` (has_characteristic) and `PATO_0002312` (cuboidal). `PATO_0002254` (flattened) was provided in the issue description.\n2.  **New Term Creation**: I will create `obo:CL_9900001` (cuboidal epithelial cell) with the logical definition: `EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_9900001 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000066 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000053 obo:PATO_0002312)))`.\n3.  **Hierarchy Update**: I will make `obo:CL_0000075` (columnar/cuboidal epithelial cell) a subclass of `obo:CL_9900001`.\n4.  **Logical Definition Update**: I will update `obo:CL_0000076` (squamous epithelial cell) to: `EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_0000076 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000066 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000053 obo:PATO_0002254)))`.\n5.  **Axiomatization**:\n    *   Search for all cells with \"squamous\" in the label or definition and add `SubClassOf(obo:CL_XXXXXXX ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000053 obo:PATO_0002254))`.\n    *   Search for all cells with \"cuboidal\" in the label or definition and add `SubClassOf(obo:CL_XXXXXXX ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000053 obo:PATO_0002312))`.\n6.  **Documentation & Patterns**: Update `docs/relations_guide.md` and add the design patterns in `src/patterns/dosdp-patterns/`.\n\nLet's start by creating the new term and updating the existing ones.","time":{"start":1778525557718,"end":1778525644825}}}
